<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 4.67 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 4.67 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 4.67 percent on Tuesday from 4.52 percent on Monday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said six banks traded on the market in 19 reported transactions with a total value of 16.7 million dinars ($24 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
